      "writtenOn": "2026-10-29T16:54:53Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I believe that different variants may have different rails that needs to be powered up or down. Do you suggest that pwrseq driver should have array of inputs that should be enabled/disabled at specific stages?\n\n@pbusse@google.com WDYT? Enabling these pins in pwrseq driver makes sens or will it clutter the pwrseq driver code too much?",
